    "updated_at": "2016-01-27T20:49:47Z",
    "body": "The way `defineTimeline` works leads bikeshed specs to require \"establishing the media timeline\" as the link text, and link to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#defineTimeline. I think we want newly-built specs to link to `#relevant-settings-object`, and if we don't want to break the build for bikeshed specs, we also need a `<dfn data-lt=\"relevant settings object for a global object\">` in the final output. Here's a patch that does this.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
